            "accordionheadingdream": "Ingrida",
            "accordionsubdream": "Holiday trip in Lithuania",
            "accordioncopydream": "Ingrida's dream was simple: a quiet holiday trip through Lithuania. A few peaceful days to rest and explore. She chose Gradiali Spa as her destination, and thanks to you, she enjoyed a well-earned weekend there.\nIngrida is a mum of five including two pairs of twins!). She usually starts her day at 4 a.m. with a quiet cup of tea, a gratitude practice, and a moment to dream. So this getaway isn't just a treat, it's a reset before the festive season kicks in.",
