            "dreamaccordionthumb": "shopify://shop_images/Aldona-icon.jpg",
            "accordionheadingdream": "Aldona",
            "accordionsubdream": "Elliptical Machine",
            "accordioncopydream": "Back in the days when the world slowed down, our lovely knitter Aldona started dreaming about a way to stay active between her knitting sessions.\n\nThanks to our Knitter's Dream Fund, we were able to make that dream come true - getting Aldona her very own elliptical machine so she could keep moving and feel energized while doing what she loves the most.",
